#: forms/list_forms.py:936
msgid "Filter types"
msgstr "MIME-typer att filtrera bort"

#: forms/list_forms.py:939
msgid ""
"MIME types to filter from the incoming posts. A list of common types can be "
"found <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Web/HTTP/Basics_of_HTTP/MIME_types/Common_types\">here </a>"
msgstr ""
"MIME-typer som ska filtreras bort från inkommande inlägg. En lista över "
"vanliga typer finns <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Web/HTTP/Basics_of_HTTP/MIME_types/Common_types\">här </a>"
